{
    "title": "Kawaii World - Craft and Build",
    "description": "Welcome to Kawaii World 3D - cute adventure game, that merges the joy of crafting and building houses, exploring pink life planet, and survival into one enchanting experience. Kawaii life has different mods for girl or boy - creative and survival mode. \r\n\r\nBUILDING MODE\r\n\r\nBuilding simulator  - is a vivid exploration of creativity and imagination, where players are invited to construct pony town from billions of blocks, decorate pink kawaii house, and inhabit their own dream home in a world brimming with cute animals and fun characters. Next to the craft pink house, to create a nice and cozy yard, where will live your pet gacha craft and his kids. Show the world your creativity and imagination in this building simulation game.\r\n\r\nINTERACT\r\n\r\nAnimals that live in craft valley will visit your rainbow city craftland and kawaii house, where you will be able to treat tasty meals to your pets: cat craft, bunny, rainbow pony, kitty craft or fluffy craft unicorn. Meet all the characters of planet craft and experience the fun game play in the construction simulator cat craft. Interact with the villagers gacha in a mini world girl craft and make a good deal with the merchant craftsman and pk crafters. Make life on the pink craft planet even more enjoyable. Take a walk in the spring garden in real life simulation game, play ball with fun kids. Like a farmer, reap the harvest of vegetables and fruits on your mini farming simulator.\r\n\r\nCRAFT MODE\r\n\r\nIf you are looking for more challenges, the craft mode in kawaii games will be a perfect choice. Immerse yourself in exploring every corner of your mini pixel world of adventure sandbox game. Fly, run, or walk around the vast craft world biomes in the game Kawaii World: Craft & Build. Collect block-shaped resources in a 3d game, mine and build, explore  islands, chase crafty prey, wage wars, and fight off mobs or monsters with other fluffy craft characters game world.\r\n\r\nTHE BEST CRAFTING AND BUILDING GAME \r\n\r\nThe free cosy game kawaii life is perfect for you. With regular updates for the craft world in 2024, you can make a real mini-opening and explore the world of your imagination in Kawaii World: Craft & Build. In planet craft, we optimized energy use to extend your play in a fun, bright pink world without constant recharges. In 2023 we made sure that touching and tapping on the screen to build your very own cute crafting empire is super easy and fun, just like playing with toy blue blocks, but on your phone or tablet! \r\n\r\n*So, what are you waiting for? Download Kawaii World 3d - a mini block world of crafting and building, an construction simulator game for free now. Become a real craftsman in kawaii life and start creating your cute world with your friends **",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to Kawaii World 3D - cute adventure game, that merges the joy of crafting and building houses, exploring pink life planet, and survival into one enchanting experience. Kawaii life has different mods for girl or boy - creative and survival mode. <br><br>BUILDING MODE<br><br>Building simulator  - is a vivid exploration of creativity and imagination, where players are invited to construct pony town from billions of blocks, decorate pink kawaii house, and inhabit their own dream home in a world brimming with cute animals and fun characters. Next to the craft pink house, to create a nice and cozy yard, where will live your pet gacha craft and his kids. Show the world your creativity and imagination in this building simulation game.<br><br>INTERACT<br><br>Animals that live in craft valley will visit your rainbow city craftland and kawaii house, where you will be able to treat tasty meals to your pets: cat craft, bunny, rainbow pony, kitty craft or fluffy craft unicorn. Meet all the characters of planet craft and experience the fun game play in the construction simulator cat craft. Interact with the villagers gacha in a mini world girl craft and make a good deal with the merchant craftsman and pk crafters. Make life on the pink craft planet even more enjoyable. Take a walk in the spring garden in real life simulation game, play ball with fun kids. Like a farmer, reap the harvest of vegetables and fruits on your mini farming simulator.<br><br>CRAFT MODE<br><br>If you are looking for more challenges, the craft mode in kawaii games will be a perfect choice. Immerse yourself in exploring every corner of your mini pixel world of adventure sandbox game. Fly, run, or walk around the vast craft world biomes in the game Kawaii World: Craft &amp; Build. Collect block-shaped resources in a 3d game, mine and build, explore  islands, chase crafty prey, wage wars, and fight off mobs or monsters with other fluffy craft characters game world.<br><br>THE BEST CRAFTING AND BUILDING GAME <br><br>The free cosy game kawaii life is perfect for you. With regular updates for the craft world in 2024, you can make a real mini-opening and explore the world of your imagination in Kawaii World: Craft &amp; Build. In planet craft, we optimized energy use to extend your play in a fun, bright pink world without constant recharges. In 2023 we made sure that touching and tapping on the screen to build your very own cute crafting empire is super easy and fun, just like playing with toy blue blocks, but on your phone or tablet! <br><br>*So, what are you waiting for? Download Kawaii World 3d - a mini block world of crafting and building, an construction simulator game for free now. Become a real craftsman in kawaii life and start creating your cute world with your friends **",
